    "notes": "Current 2025 BAG replaces obsolete oversized OSM relation footprint; new 2024 pale-brick entrance and former school, current open courtyard. Adjoining 1986 nursery explicitly retained as blue contextual mass because suppression of the old unified OSM relation removes it too. 18.3 m museum height from old OSM relation/3DBAG; nursery height approx 14.3 m from architect elevation. As-built roof override: the current BAG legal contour includes open rear garden. Winhov 2024 site plan confines restored school/entrance to roughly 16 m depth at the street, leaving approximately 30 m depth as unroofed rear garden; only low perimeter walls and paths occupy it.",
